msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fun_project/07-fun_Doorbell.rst:27
msgid "The \"doorbell\" project aims to simulate the function of a doorbell. When a button is pressed, the Arduino plays a predefined melody using a passive buzzer module."
msgstr ""

